    <details style="margin:4px 0 10px 0;">
    <summary style="cursor:pointer;color:#ffebee;">👉 Show answer</summary>
    <div style="background:#0b1a2e;border-radius:8px;padding:8px 12px;margin-top:6px;color:#ffebee;">Tension (deflection), cracks, glazing or fraying.</div>
    </details>
